  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "cell_index": 1,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "缩聚",
      "text_sha256": "92C5424F092CEB53F93D00D6614FCEE0A7D46C0626BC1E2BF1F11827BE36A985",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[1]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 1,
      "kind": "code",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "style": "code",
      "text": "index1 = [1,2];\nindex2 = [3,4,5,6,7,8];\nK2 = KRren;\nK2(index1,index1) = KRren(index1,index1)-KPren;\nK2(index2,index2) = KRren(index2,index2)-KNren;\nC2 = CRren;\nC2(index1,index1) = CRren(index1,index1)-CPren;\nC2(index2,index2) = CRren(index2,index2)-CNren;\nC1 = CRren-C2;\nK1 = KRren-K2;\n\ndt = 1/1024;\nal = (4*MRren+2*dt*CRren+dt^2*KRren)\\MRren*4;\nal = diag(diag(al));",
      "text_sha256": "96079D6E4E6A51CB50C1B2A16DCC515DE5DAE899BA4E3EBD6C93FE059936633E",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[2]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 2,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "\\frac{X\\left(z\\right)}{F\\left(z\\right)}=\\frac{1}{\\frac{{\\left(z-1\\right)}^2 }{\\alpha z\\Delta t^2 }M+\\frac{z-1}{z\\Delta t}C_1 +{\\mathrm{K}}_1 +z^{-j} \\left(\\frac{z-1}{z\\Delta t}C_2 +{\\mathrm{K}}_2 \\right)}",
      "text_sha256": "1D75124C33541F352B7F523ECDFFC4619B9537F85C02CFBD152AFC174D7F9A11",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[3]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 3,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "按照上述公式计算传递函数",
      "text_sha256": "2DE48E6C7EBCE8E9674178E8867BE5525F78B1C131C4D607603034B85BBF28A2",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[4]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 2,
      "kind": "code",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "style": "code",
      "text": "% 2. 选择矩阵 S: 6x15\nS = zeros(2, 6);\n\n% 定义映射：小矩阵第1-3行 → 大矩阵第1-3行\n% 小矩阵第4-6行 → 大矩阵第6-8行\nrow_map = [1 2];\n\nfor i = 1:2\n    S(i, row_map(i)) = 1;\nend\n\nM = MPren;\nC = CPren;\nK = KPren;\nn = length(M);\n% 系统矩阵\nA = [zeros(n) eye(n); -M\\K -M\\C];\nB = [zeros(n); M\\eye(n)];\n\n% 连续系统 -> 离散\nsys_c = ss(A, B, eye(2*n), zeros(2*n, n));\ndt = 1/1024;  % 离散化周期\nsys_d = c2d(sys_c, dt);\nAd = sys_d.A;\nBd = sys_d.B;\n\nQ = diag([4e8, 1e4, 1e2, 1e1]);\nR = diag([3e-3,1e-2]);\n[K_lqr, ~, ~] = dlqr(Ad, Bd, Q, R);\n% 闭环系统矩阵\nAcl = Ad - Bd * K_lqr;\n\n% 分解增益为刚度、阻尼反馈\nDeltaK = diag(diag(MPren*K_lqr(:, 1:n)))\nDeltaC = diag(diag(MPren*K_lqr(:, n+1:end)));\n\nDeltaG = (z-1)/z/dt*DeltaC+DeltaK;\n\n%for l = 1:20\n%    for j = 1:30",
      "text_sha256": "69F15A93DD1DD053026AC3C77CE5E3F608A6C23D68B5F8842F2F82DBD179F4FF",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[5]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 4,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "这里不采用之前的阻尼矩阵进行缩聚，而是采用使用缩聚后的刚度和阻尼矩阵求出新的阻尼",
      "text_sha256": "6EDAA2DC4559EC4FCC9D9296D5FF2E8391A46BB187D4F7607A57B92558D3E4FE",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[6]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 5,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "实际测试表明两者没有区别，虽然矩阵数值上存在差距，但是稳定域没差别",
      "text_sha256": "E2B5ACE1F26382F8215930B73F8CC7B98C97E3976E40E3E99FFEAC3B30969DF1",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[7]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "定义循环，求解稳定域",
      "text_sha256": "1F02EA3680ADE6C074E485CF9E12A8E6A0372679B1ED9B1F154F0AD4D2AC46E5",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[8]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 3,
      "kind": "code",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "style": "code",
      "text": "stab = zeros(20);\nfor l = 0:15\n%l =5;\n%for j = 0:15\n%j = 25;\nj = 0;\n%j = 0;\n%z=tf('z',dt);\nsyms z\n%l = 19;\n%j = 5;\nH = sym(eye(6,6));\nH(1,1) = z^(-l);\nH(2,2) = z^(-j);\n\n%syms z\nG = (z-1)^2/z/dt^2*MRren/al+(z-1)/z/dt*C1+K1+...\n    ((z-1)/z/dt*C2+K2)*H+S'*DeltaG*S;\n%G = (z-1)^2/z/dt^2*MNren/al+(z-1)/z/dt*CNren+KNren+...\n%    S'*H*((z-1)/z/dt*CPren+KPren+(z-1)/z/dt*Kd_ctrl+Kp_ctrl)*S;\ndet_G = det(G);\nGcls_zero = vpa(solve(det_G == 0, z));\ns = max(abs(Gcls_zero))\nstab(l+1,j+1) = s;\nend\n%end",
      "text_sha256": "C62006CB1B4755984CF1AAB8210352A657230F16EC16A3CCF1CED050DDFAA329",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[9]"
    }
  ],
  "source_name": "luxvjie_guyan_LQR2.mlx",
